; 49-info.kurt

; `info SYMBOL` asks about one symbol: its declarations, its `def` if it has one, and every
; retained fact that mentions it. (`list` is about files, `info` about symbols: `info four` is
; always the symbol, even when a file `four.kurt` is loaded.)

load number
calc on

def four = 2 + 2       "four"
four = 4

info four
